3. PRIVACY POLICY & DATA PROTECTION NOTICE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NutriAI is committed to maintaining the highest standards of data privacy and 
security for all personal and health telemetry information.

A. Information We Collect:
- Account Data: Name, email address, password hash (PBKDF2/BCrypt encrypted).
- Health & Clinical Telemetry: Self-reported symptoms, blood report lab values, 
  height, weight, age, gender, activity levels, and dietary preferences.
- Audio & Preference Logs: Custom sound studio presets, mood logs, and breathing timers.

B. How Your Data is Used & Secured:
- Your data is strictly used to power personalized AI nutrient deficiency predictions, 
  generate tailored meal plans, and summarize health reports.
- DATA IS NEVER SOLD, RENTED, OR SHARED WITH THIRD-PARTY ADVERTISERS.
- Authentication data is secured via JSON Web Tokens (JWT) with encrypted session keys.

C. PWA Offline Caching & Cookies:
- Local offline data is cached strictly on your local device via Web Storage 
  (localStorage & IndexedDB) to enable Progressive Web App (PWA) offline usage.

D. User Rights:
- Users reserve the full right to update their health profile, clear local cached 
  data, or request account data deletion at any time.

